{
  "_comment": "All bytes are 0x-hex, lower case; uint values are JSON numbers. Generated by clients/clientkeys/scripts/pqchat-vectors.mjs (src/pqchat.js); never edit by hand. Random inputs are fixed: rnd(name, n) = the first n bytes of keccak256(\"scaas/pqchat/vectors/<name>/0\") ‖ keccak256(\"scaas/pqchat/vectors/<name>/1\") ‖ …; the labels are in the generator. Sources: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-25-ua7-pq-e2e-sessions.md (§4, §6, §7, §10), docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-pqchat-public-topics.md (§2), plan block \"Group 3c\" (3C-D3, 3C-D5, 3C-D9). UNAUDITED. The session records (spec §4). DS_C = keccak256(abi.encode(keccak256(domain.type), keccak256(name), keccak256(version))); typed = keccak256(0x1901 ‖ DS_C ‖ hashStruct); uaMessage.digest = uaMessage(kind, purpose.hash, typed) (ua.js, kind 0x0131 mldsa65). Ids: sessionId = keccak256(abi.encode(tag session, creator, uint64 nonce)) (also epoch 0's epochId); epochId = keccak256(abi.encode(tag epoch, sessionId, author, uint64 nonce)); a leave's and a message's id = typed. Scopes (3C-D5): session keccak256(abi.encode(tag scope/session, creator)); epoch and leave keccak256(abi.encode(tag scope/epoch, sessionId, author or member)); message keccak256(abi.encode(tag scope/message, epochId, sender, uint32 device)), its nonce = counter. The session's members are sorted by ua, carol's via is a non-zero msig seat; its wrapHashes are keys.json wraps \"session/*\" in member order, its sealedInfo messages.json sealedInfo \"session\"; the epoch's are \"epoch-1/*\" and \"epoch-1\". Signers: ML-DSA-65 keys by pq.js pqKeygen(seed, \"mldsa65\", account, index), signatures by pq.js signUA (deterministic, extraEntropy false), UASig keyData and members empty. The message row: sigHash = keccak256(abi.encode(UASig)), UASig = (bytes keyData, bytes signature, (uint16, (uint16, bytes)[], bytes)[] members); blob = abi.encode(record as its ABI tuple, sigHash) (3C-D3).",
